sequenceDiagram
    participant DAC as De-Identification Requester<br/>(DAC)
    participant MGR as De-ID Manager
    participant DI_C as De-Identifier<br/>(R4 clinical and lab)
    participant DI_I as De-Identifier<br/>(R5 CT measurements)

    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x1 Submit Job (R4 Job Task, async)
    Note over MGR: Validate permit and both policies<br/>before accepting the job
    MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted, Content-Location job-url
    opt Acceptance response lost
        DAC->>MGR: Repeat ITI-x1 with DIS-Submission: recover
        MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted, same URL, DIS-Submission: replayed
    end

    MGR->>DI_C: ITI-x3 Submit Task (R4 clinical set, sync)
    Note over DI_C: Requested removal of Patient.name<br/>and retention of lab links
    DI_C-->>MGR: 200 OK (R4 clinical result and evidence)

    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x4 GET job-url
    MGR-->>DAC: 202 Accepted (in progress)

    MGR->>DI_I: ITI-x3 Submit Task (R5 measurement set, sync)
    Note over DI_I: Requested removal of the patient reference
    DI_I-->>MGR: 200 OK (R5 measurement result and R4 evidence)
    Note over MGR: Validate both sets and recheck<br/>release authorization
    DAC->>MGR: ITI-x4 GET job-url
    MGR-->>DAC: 200 OK (R4 Parameters with both sets and evidence)
    Note over DAC: Deliver both approved sets to the SPE<br/>(outside DIS)
